","r":[0.1278,0.7148,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Odette","r":[0.1741,0.7148,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Valeriy","r":[0.2204,0.7148,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Mitya","r":[0.0815,0.7778,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Wriothesley","r":[0.1278,0.7778,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Valeriy","r":[0.2204,0.7778,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Mitya","r":[0.0815,0.8407,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"qiqi","r":[0.1278,0.8407,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Sucrose","r":[0.1741,0.8407,0.0389,0.0311]},{"n":"Valeriy","r":[0.2204,0.8407,0.0389,0.0311]}]}]}},"thumb":"content/genshin/builds/mitya/261111-225116/en-1.t.webp","why":{"w":[{"name":"Starsealed Edict","text":"Provides CRIT DMG, EM, and powerful Stellar-Conduct CRIT bonuses. Mitya's strongest signature option for both playstyles."},{"name":"A Thousand Floating Dreams","text":"Provides substantial EM and shares additional EM with teammates. Excellent for off-field Mitya's support role."},{"name":"Kagura's Verity","text":"Provides high CD and Skill DMG bonuses."},{"name":"Winter's Heavy Heart","text":"Provides CRIT DMG, EM, and Stellar Glimmer damage bonuses based on Cryo and Electro teammates. An excellent four-star option."},{"name":"Dawning Frost","text":"CRIT DMG with EM after Charged Attack and Skill hits. Strong for Mitya’s Stellar Glimmer damage."},{"name":"Clash of Kings","text":"Provides 27.6% CRIT Rate and, after using an Elemental Skill, grants ATK and EM bonuses, making it a strong 4-star option for Mitya."},{"name":"Sunny Morning Sleep-In","text":"Elemental Mastery and reaction-related damage utility; best suited to reaction-centered builds."},{"name":"Etherlight Spindlelute","text":"Energy Recharge event catalyst; helps meet Burst needs where personal damage is secondary."}],"a":[{"names":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"text":"Boosts Stellar-Conduct damage by 40% and grants 16% conditional CRIT Rate. A strong on-field damage set.","stats":"EM · EM · CR/CD"},{"names":["Gilded Dreams"],"text":"Provides EM after triggering reactions.","stats":""},{"names":["Heart of the Furnace"],"text":"Boosts teamwide Stellar Glimmer damage after triggering its reactions. Best for off-field support when no teammate already carries it.","stats":""}],"t":[{"name":"On-Field Live Wire","members":["Mitya","Yae Miko","Odette","Valeriy"],"text":"Mitya leads with powerful Stellar-Conduct attacks, while Yae adds Electro damage, Odette boosts reactions, and Valeriy shields and buffs.","roles":["On-field DPS","Off-field DPS","Cryo Enabler / Buffer","Shielder / Buffer"]},{"name":"Off-Field Puppet","members":["Mitya","Sandrone","Odette","Valeriy"],"text":"Sandrone leads the damage while Mitya supplies off-field Stellar-Conduct support. Odette boosts reactions, and Valeriy adds protection.","roles":["Off-field DPS / Enabler","On-field DPS","Cryo Enabler / Buffer","Shielder / Buffer"]},{"name":"Maximum Security","members":["Mitya","Wriothesley","Traveler (Cryo)","Valeriy"],"text":"Wriothesley deals on-field Cryo damage while Mitya supports Stellar-Conduct. Cryo Traveler adds application, and Valeriy provides protection.","roles":["Off-field DPS / Enabler","On-field DPS","Cryo Enabler / Sub DPS","Shielder / Buffer"]},{"name":"Economitya F2P","members":["Mitya","qiqi","Sucrose","Valeriy"],"text":"Mitya drives Stellar-Conduct while Valeriy shields, Sucrose shares EM and groups enemies, and Qiqi supplies Cryo and healing.","roles":["On-field DPS","Healer","EM Buffer / Debuffer","Shielder / Buffer"]}],"v":"On-field Stellar-Conduct: Use Hold Skill and enhanced Charged Attacks for Stellar-Conduct damage. Prioritize EM, CRIT, and uninterrupted attack windows.\nOff-field Support: Use Tap Skill and swap out to provide teamwide EM and Stellar-Conduct damage. Burst is generally optional.\nPremium Conduct: Pair Mitya with Odette, Yae Miko, and Valeriy for strong reaction buffs, Electro damage, and shielding.\nAccessible Team: Use affordable Cryo and Electro teammates, with Sucrose for EM sharing. Prioritize reliable reactions and protection.\nC1 Energy Comfort: C1 restores Energy and improves Beacon generation, reducing ER demands. Invest more into EM and CRIT when Burst uptime is comfortable.","n":3},"seo":{"roles":["On & Off-field"],"about":"Flexible Stellar-Conduct unit who can be played as either an on-field DPS or off-field support. His C0 dmg is solid, while his Cons significantly boost both his personal dmg and team utility.","pros":["On/Off-Field Flexibility","Strong Constellations","Short Rotations","Team EM Buff"],"cons":["C0 is just OK","Energy Hungry","Easily Interrupted","Stellar-Conduct Reliant"],"weapons":["Starsealed Edict","A Thousand Floating Dreams","Kagura's Verity","Winter's Heavy Heart","Dawning Frost","Clash of Kings","Sunny Morning Sleep-In","Etherlight Spindlelute"],"arts":[{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Main DPS"},{"sets":["Heart of the Furnace"],"pcs":"4 pcs","role":"Off-field"}],"main":["Elemental Mastery","Elemental Mastery","Crit Rate / Crit DMG"],"stats":["EM: 500-700+","Crit Rate: 50-70% (Before Set Bonus)","Crit DMG: 200%+","ER: 100-150%"],"vars":[{"title":"On-field Stellar-Conduct","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Starsealed Edict","Kagura's Verity","Dawning Frost"],"arts":[{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Build EM and CRIT; check ER for Burst uptime.","teams":"Cryo and Electro teammates; reliable Stellar-Conduct.","when":"Use his damage-focused Skill mode and Beacon-enhanced attacks.","cond":"Protect against interruption while charging.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Off-field Conduct Support","role":"Support","weapons":["Starsealed Edict","A Thousand Floating Dreams","Clash of Kings"],"arts":[{"sets":["Heart of the Furnace"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prioritize EM and team utility; Burst often optional.","teams":"Stellar-Conduct carry and consistent Cryo/Electro reactions.","when":"Use his support Skill mode to buff reaction damage from off-field.","cond":"Do not assume on-field damage passives work off-field.","notes":"","pre":false},{"title":"Lower-cost Conduct DPS","role":"On-field DPS","weapons":["Dawning Frost","Clash of Kings"],"arts":[{"sets":["Disenchantment in Deep Shadow"],"pcs":"4 pcs"},{"sets":["Gilded Dreams"],"pcs":"4 pcs"}],"stats":"Prioritize EM/CRIT and enough ER for rotation.","teams":"A functional Stellar-Conduct enabler.","when":"Accessible route to Mitya’s damage-focused playstyle.","cond":"Check individual weapon passive trigger conditions.","notes":"","pre":false}],"mats":["Vajrada Amethyst Sliver","Vajrada Amethyst Fragment","Vajrada Amethyst Chunk","Vajrada Amethyst Gemstone","Shattered Stability Anchor","Teachings of Charity","Guide to Charity","Philosophies of Charity","Chimeric Core","Chimeric Core","Symbiotic Chimeric Nucleus","Crystalfold","Mask of the Virtuous Doctor","Crown of Insight","Mora","Hero's Wit"],"talents":[{"name":"Chain Reaction","pri":"Level 9+"},{"name":"Principle: Variable Detection","pri":"Level 6+"},{"name":"Analysis: Gradient Theory","pri":"Level 9+"}],"teams":[{"name":"On-Field Live Wire","members":["Mitya","Yae Miko","Odette","Valeriy"]},{"name":"Off-Field Puppet","members":["Mitya","Sandrone","Odette","Valeriy"]},{"name":"Maximum Security","members":["Mitya","Wriothesley","Traveler (Cryo)","Valeriy"]},{"name":"Economitya F2P","members":["Mitya","qiqi","Sucrose","Valeriy"]}]}}],"title":"Mitya","el":"Electro"}